---
import Page from '../../components/Page.astro';
import SubMenuStatement from '../../components/SubMenuStatement.astro';
import { site } from '../../lib/data.js';
const links = [
  { label: 'From the Board Chair', href: '/about-the-foundation/from-the-board-chair/' },
  { label: 'Our History', href: '/about-the-foundation/our-history/' },
  { label: 'Our Approach', href: '/about-the-foundation/our-approach/' },
  { label: 'Our People', href: '/about-the-foundation/our-people/' },
  { label: 'Financials', href: '/about-the-foundation/financials/' },
  { label: 'In the News', href: '/category/in-the-news/' },
  { label: `${site.currentReportYear} Annual Report`, href: '/annual-reports/' },
];
---
<Page title="About the Foundation" section="about" image="/images/banner-about.svg" alt="Illustration of students raising hands in a classroom">
  <h3>Strong Starts. Lasting Results.</h3>
  <p>The Wexmoor Foundation invests in public education, with a clear focus on <a href="/what-we-fund/early-grades-achievement/">early grades achievement</a> and on <a href="/what-we-fund/educators-leaders/">excellent educators and school leaders</a>, the two foundations on which every student&rsquo;s success is built.</p>
  <p>As a private family foundation, we look for partners who share our sense of urgency. Our support goes beyond dollars: we give our time, our voice and our convening power. We learn by listening to the people closest to students&mdash;teachers whose classrooms consistently outperform expectations, principals who have turned schools around, and leaders of organizations that are meeting ambitious goals. We build relationships with high-performing organizations and results-focused school systems because we believe that, working together, we can help every child read, learn and lead.</p>
  <h3>Our Commitment to Equity and Belonging</h3>
  <p class="last">As a foundation dedicated to an excellent public education for every student, The Wexmoor Foundation is committed to equity in how we learn, how we work and where we invest. You can read more about how we reflect, learn and improve <a href="/our-commitment-to-equity/">here</a>.</p>
  <SubMenuStatement links={links} statement={`The Wexmoor Foundation invests around ${site.annualGiving} each year to strengthen public education.`} />
</Page>
